---
import PagesLayout from "../../layouts/PagesLayout.astro";
---

<PagesLayout
  title="Docs"
  description="Overview pages for the native initiative packages."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Docs", href: "/docs/" }]}
>
  <h1>Docs</h1>
  <p>
    Documentation for the <a href="https://github.com/okikio/native">native</a> initiative and its packages. Pick a
    package below for its overview, API guide, and examples.
  </p>

  <h2><a href="/docs/manager/">@okikio/manager</a></h2>
  <p>
    Store keyed values with a collection built around Map. Manager adds convenience methods and returns arrays
    from its keys and values methods.
  </p>

  <h2><a href="/docs/emitter/">@okikio/emitter</a></h2>
  <p>Connect application components through named events and listeners.</p>

  <h2><a href="/docs/animate/">@okikio/animate</a></h2>
  <p>
    Create and control browser animations through the Web Animations API.
  </p>

  <h2><a href="/docs/native/">@okikio/native</a></h2>
  <p>
    Organize browser behavior into an application and its services. Optional PJAX navigation fetches the next page
    and replaces its content without a full reload.
  </p>
</PagesLayout>
